            <ArticleTitle>[Recent acquisitions on the pharmacology and therapeutic uses of theophylline with special reference to cardiovascular effects].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>233-44</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors review clinical indications for the use of theophylline, its pharmacological properties and the most recent acquisitions concerning its pharmacokinetics and mechanism of action. Special attention has been devoted to the effects of this 1,3-dimethylxanthine on the cardiovascular apparatus in relation to a possible antianginal activity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
